		},
		{
			"id": "TiVOGy7X9544HC8B4",
			"name": "Primaris Astartes",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Cawl's Primaris strain adds three further organs on top of the standard nineteen, developed to make a Marine somewhat larger, tougher, and more enduring without changing what made the original gene-seed work. This trait is added on top of the Astartes ancestry trait above, not used in place of it.\n\nDesign: 25 (Sinew Coils) + 11 (Magnificat) + 10 (Belisarian Furnace) = 46 points, added to the base Astartes package's 573 for 619 points of physiology before skills. See the Primaris Battle-Brother template.",
			"tags": [
				"Advantage",
				"Physical",
				"Imperium",
				"Adeptus Astartes",
				"Primaris"
			],
			"container_type": "meta_trait",
			"children": [
				{
					"id": "twfwWKVMNVij_eM5R",
					"name": "Sinew Coils",
					"local_notes": "Lore: Reinforces muscle fibre and tendon with denser, faster-cycling tissue, giving Primaris Marines their somewhat greater size and quicker reactions relative to Firstborn Astartes.\n\nDesign: Increased ST +2 (B14, 10/level, 20) plus Increased Basic Speed +0.25 (B17, 5) = 25 points, stacking with the base Astartes Attribute Modifiers.",
					"tags": [
						"Physical"
					],
					"base_points": 25,
					"features": [
						{
							"type": "attribute_bonus",
							"attribute": "st",
							"amount": 2
						},
						{
							"type": "attribute_bonus",
							"attribute": "basic_speed",
							"amount": 0.25
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"id": "TG8QqRNRT2cq6QhQq",
					"name": "Magnificat",
					"local_notes": "Lore: Boosts the endocrine system that governs growth and wound repair, so a Primaris Marine's tissue knits measurably faster between battles than a Firstborn Astartes' already-quick healing.\n\nDesign: Regeneration (Slow) (B80, 10 points) for the passive extra healing, plus a 1-point Perk for general hormonal stability. 11 points.",
					"container_type": "meta_trait",
					"children": [
						{
							"id": "tZIUqjY_ZKYO_YbY9",
							"name": "Accelerated Recovery",
							"reference": "B80",
							"local_notes": "Regeneration (Slow): recover 1 HP per 12 hours even without rest or first aid.",
							"base_points": 10
						},
						{
							"id": "t6H3_s0fAb_K-qO-c",
							"name": "Hormonal Regulation",
							"base_points": 1
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"id": "T3oJa1Ueohmxjti2K",
					"name": "Belisarian Furnace",
					"local_notes": "Lore: An additional organ, unique to the Primaris strain, that burns fuel far more efficiently than a Firstborn Astartes' already formidable metabolism, giving noticeably greater stamina on extended campaigns.\n\nDesign: Extra Fatigue Points +3 (B16, 3/level, 9 points) plus a 1-point Perk for the general metabolic efficiency. 10 points.",
					"container_type": "meta_trait",
					"children": [
						{
							"id": "tHsYB0_j2tKNzo6wv",
							"name": "Metabolic Reserve",
							"reference": "B16",
							"local_notes": "Extra Fatigue Points +3.",
							"points_per_level": 3,
							"can_level": true,
							"levels": 3
						},
						{
							"id": "txol52gVECTfDXQRA",
							"name": "Efficient Metabolism",
							"base_points": 1
						}
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": "t80OjpvKYKXESFoS2",
			"name": "Personal Advancement",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Individual variation applies to Primaris Marines the same as Firstborn: the same augmentation regime, run through Cawl's expanded gene-seed, still produces a range of outcomes rather than identical copies.\n\nDesign: DX+1 (20) + IQ+1 (20) + HT+1 (10) + Will+1 (5) + Per+1 (5) = 60, matching the Firstborn Battle-Brother's Personal Advancement package.",
			"tags": [
				"Physical",
				"Mental"
			],
			"base_points": 60,
			"features": [
				{
					"type": "attribute_bonus",
					"attribute": "dx",
					"amount": 1
				},
				{
					"type": "attribute_bonus",
					"attribute": "iq",
					"amount": 1
				},
				{
					"type": "attribute_bonus",
					"attribute": "ht",
					"amount": 1
				},
				{
					"type": "attribute_bonus",
					"attribute": "will",
					"amount": 1
				},
				{
					"type": "attribute_bonus",
					"attribute": "per",
					"amount": 1
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": "tR7E2tW4CGMlBZRMx",
			"name": "Rank 2 (Battle-Brother, Primaris Strike Force)",
			"reference": "B29",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Standing within his squad and company, built up over a shorter career than a Firstborn veteran's but still marking him as a proven, trusted Battle-Brother.\n\nDesign: Rank (B29), 5 points/level, 2 levels = 10 points.",
			"base_points": 10
		}
	],
